(16. Appendices) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Appendix A - Canonical glossary) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Term | Short definition |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| Capability | Evidence-backed contextual ability with confidence and provenance. |) Tj
T*
(| Evidence | Provenance-bearing support or contradiction for a claim. |) Tj
T*
(| Confidence | Calibrated support under uncertainty. |) Tj
T*
(| Provenance | Lineage of data, evidence, inference, or claim. |) Tj
T*
(| Credential | Verifiable issuer claim about subject/status/achievement. |) Tj
T*
(| Passport | Portable, versioned package of selected verified claims. |) Tj
T*
(| Ontology version | Immutable semantic release used by events/graph/AI. |) Tj
T*
(| Overlay | Jurisdiction/institution extension that does not redefine global meaning. |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Appendix B - Relationship matrix) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| From \\ To | Skill | Knowledge | Capability | Evidence | Credential | Occupation | Jurisdiction |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| Skill | is_a, requires | requires | part_of | none | none | mapped_to | overlay only |) Tj
T*
(| Knowledge | supports | is_a, part_of | requires | none | none | mapped_to | overlay only |) Tj
T*
(| Capability | requires | requires | is_a, depends_on | evidenced_by | supported_by | recommended_for inverse | ) Tj
T*
(regulated_by when applicable |) Tj
T*
(| Evidence | demonstrates | demonstrates | demonstrates/supports/contradicts | derived_from | supports | none | ) Tj
T*
(jurisdiction metadata |) Tj
T*
(| Credential | none | none | supports | evidenced_by | is_a | regulated_by | regulated_by |) Tj
T*
(| Occupation | requires | requires | requires | none | requires | is_a | regulated_by |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
