(Claim: Person can design normalized relational schemas.) Tj
T*
(Evidence: Graded schema project, rubric score 91%, instructor feedback, SQL migration artifact.) Tj
T*
(Ontology: capability:sql_data_modeling requires knowledge:normal_forms and skill:relationship_modeling.) Tj
T*
(Reasoning: Evidence demonstrates required skill and knowledge in project context.) Tj
T*
(Confidence: 0.84 because evidence is recent, assessed, artifact-backed, and aligned; not 0.95 because context is ) Tj
T*
(academic not production.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Appendix K - Ontology validation rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Every concept must have one canonical definition.) Tj
T*
(2. Every active concept must have at least one parent except root concepts.) Tj
T*
(3. No concept may be both active and deprecated.) Tj
T*
(4. Deprecated concepts must include replacement or rationale.) Tj
T*
(5. External mappings must state equivalence relation.) Tj
T*
(6. Capability concepts must define required evidence types or evidence guidance.) Tj
ET
endstream
