() Tj
T*
(ONT-001 establishes Syrka's official semantic constitution. Every future API, event, graph, ) Tj
T*
(database, AI model, recommendation engine, dashboard, credential, passport, connector, and ) Tj
T*
(external integration must use these definitions or explicitly propose a versioned ontology ) Tj
T*
(change.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The ontology guarantees that every concept has exactly one canonical meaning; every capability ) Tj
T*
(is grounded in evidence; every inference is explainable; every relationship is formally defined;) Tj
T*
( every AI decision is semantically constrained; and Syrka remains independent of any LMS, ) Tj
T*
(database, AI provider, or jurisdiction while supporting versioned overlays for local ) Tj
T*
(requirements.) Tj
